msgstr "https://www.linknacional.com.br/wordpress"

#. Description of the plugin
#: wc-better-shipping-calculator-for-brazil.php
msgid ""
"Brazilian checkout fields (CPF/CNPJ, address number, neighborhood and phone) "
"with automatic CEP address pre-filling for WooCommerce."
msgstr ""
"Brazilian checkout fields (CPF/CNPJ, address number, neighborhood and phone) "
"with automatic CEP address pre-filling for WooCommerce."

